      "restriction": "",
      "rulesText": "Toughened leathers cannot be combined with the effects of any other armour except a helmet or buckler (so not a shield).❓\n\nToughened leathers cannot be sold back at the Trading Posts; the stench alone is enough to drive away even the most desperate of buyers!\n\nEven though Toughened Leathers are purchased as miscellaneous equipment and need not be listed on a Hero’s starting armour list to be taken, they are still armour and prevent spell casting.✏️"
